<programme start="20261028230000 +0000" stop="20261029020000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Pittsburgh at Miami</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Panthers (5-2) visit the No. 1 Hurricanes (6-0) in an ACC matchup. The Hurricanes beat the Seminoles 43-35 in overtime behind three TDs from Darian Mensah. The Panthers fell to the Eagles 27-21 and rely on QB Mason Heintschel who has 14 TDs.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
