<programme start="20261029040000 +0000" stop="20261029043000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Iruma-kun From Demon School</sub-title><desc lang="en">Iruma Suzuki arrives at the mansion of the great demon Sullivan, who then proceeds to adopt him as his grandson and enrolls him at Babyls School for Demons.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20191005</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/c98fba09a2fa554777a60a0b14e4637d.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029043000 +0000" stop="20261029050000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Familiars Summoned!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Iruma and his fellow students are taught how to summon familiars, which will establish their rank and what class they&apos;re placed in.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20191012</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E02</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/b5dd3d84c92f284f9a026037300c8d19.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029050000 +0000" stop="20261029053000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Iruma and Clara; Demon Friends</sub-title><desc lang="en">Iruma and Asmodeus encounter a rather strange girl named Valac Clara; Iruma becomes closer to both Asmodeus and Clara.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20191019</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/df33ba2d53404f2d579c755ee5d1a67f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029053000 +0000" stop="20261029060000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The Misfit Class</sub-title><desc lang="en">Iruma, Asmodeus, and Clara end up in the Misfit Class, which, as the name suggests, is full of misfits.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20191026</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/b52d9e860975cee77abee6e3e4382e3a.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029060000 +0000" stop="20261029063000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The One Who Wants to Be Demon King</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Misfit Class is in the middle of a flying race in order to determine their ranks, but since Iruma is human, he can&apos;t fly.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor><actor>Kellen Goff</actor><actor>Ryan Levy</actor><actor>Brandon Winckler</actor><actor>Landon McDonald</actor></credits><date>20191102</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/6449eface9bd79c1a28a9da22341a1df.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029063000 +0000" stop="20261029070000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Ameri&apos;s Theory</sub-title><desc lang="en">Iruma is still doing everything he can to not stand out at school, but an incident occurs in class involving the Gluttonous Feeder ring.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor><actor>Brian Anderson</actor><actor>D.C. Douglas</actor><actor>Ryan Levy</actor><actor>Landon McDonald</actor></credits><date>20191109</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/909f63f4249ffb35f19b601bf03618b3.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029070000 +0000" stop="20261029073000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">First Love Memories</sub-title><desc lang="en">When Ameri and Iruma bump into each other, Iruma finds out that Ameri has a shojo manga from the human world called &quot;First Love Memories.&quot;</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor><actor>Brian Anderson</actor><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>D.C. Douglas</actor><actor>Kellen Goff</actor></credits><date>20191116</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E07</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/c8c2ceb3bd4306fecff850b31de8de98.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029073000 +0000" stop="20261029080000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Head Over Heels for Clara</sub-title><desc lang="en">To try to get Iruma to pay attention to her again, Clara starts to take succubus charming lessons with the succubus teacher Raim.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20191123</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.7.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E08</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/ec99eb9d1845fdb0aa444557c5900691.jpeg"/></programme>
