<programme start="20261029083000 +0000" stop="20261029090000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Fierce Battle, Execution Cannonball!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The day of the rank promotion test involving execution cannonball has arrived; Iruma is ready for the match, but then ends up on a different team than Asmodeus.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20191207</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.9.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E10</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/bd794e2ec1fa11cd616bea08443e067a.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029090000 +0000" stop="20261029093000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Together With Familiars!</sub-title><desc lang="en">A new teacher named Balse Robin, who is quite innocent and fearful of nothing, arrives; Iruma decides his next goal now that he&apos;s moved up a rank.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor><actor>Brian Anderson</actor><actor>Griffin Burns</actor><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>D.C. Douglas</actor></credits><date>20191214</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.10.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E11</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/3c36be969a3a8473a8a2867ba4b7e86e.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029093000 +0000" stop="20261029100000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The Rookie Hunt!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Battlers&apos; recruiting operation, the Rookie Hunt, has begun, and the seniors all come out to try to find worthy first-years to join their groups.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20191221</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.11.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E12</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/42a681b266a114111f50b1380a754ddb.jpeg"/></programme>
