<programme start="20261029203000 +0000" stop="20261029210000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">End-of-Terminus Exams; Girls&apos; Talk</sub-title><desc lang="en">Iruma and the rest of the Misfit Class try to avoid failing and having to take supplementary classes; Clara drags Ameri off to meet with Elizabetta and Keroli for some girls&apos; time; they start talking about relationships and things start heating up.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210626</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.10.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E11</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/e875cdbf0ac15d2dbf706a6ee55ffe72.jpeg"/></programme>
