<programme start="20261028100000 +0000" stop="20261028110000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">How Did They Build That?</title><sub-title lang="en">Tunnels &amp; Towers</sub-title><desc lang="en">In Chicago, twin concrete towers push the limits of high-rise design. Engineers conquer the sea to unite Sweden and Denmark. And in Sydney, Norman Foster and team take on the challenge of a new metro station that can&apos;t disrupt the busy streets above.</desc><category lang="en">Instructional</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p19223615_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
